Veltrans confirmed the new template since 19 Oct and will not revert, so I ch=
anged the bot instead. It now has a fallback: if the total is not on page 1 i=
t searches all pages for the totals block. I tested it on 3 of the 12 invoice=
s in the test environment and the totals matched.

I scheduled a rerun of the whole batch of 12 for the night of 23 Oct. The bot=
 will post what it can and leave anything with missing data in the exception =
folder. You can check the results afterwards.

Regards,
