Hello Pieter, yes, we moved to a new invoice template with our billing system=
 update on 19 Oct. For invoices with more than one page the totals block now =
sits on the last page. This is the final layout and we will not revert it. Ot=
her fields (invoice number, date, PO reference, IBAN) have the same labels as=
 before, only the position differs slightly. Sorry for the inconvenience, we =
should have announced it.

Best regards,
Veltrans Billing
Billing team of Veltrans (road carrier)

